window.products.push({"id":845069,"name":"Better Butter Porcelain Butter Dish, Butter Dish with Lid, Butter Keeper - Hold 4oz East/West Coast Butter Stick and 8oz Kerrygold Butter - Easy to Gr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Wia1GXyEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy to Hold Grip - A great handle is very important when working with butter and oil’s last thing you need is a butter holder with no handle! The lovely handle is easier to hang on to and replace the cover even if your fingers have butter on them. What could be better than that? Cute Shape - Classic circular design made with high-quality glazed finish gives this white butter dish a modern look and matches any home décor. This butter dish with cover could be placed in the refrigerator or countertop. And it will keep your cat out of the butter, let the kitchen look tidy and organized. Useful Edge - It has a rim deep enough so that if you accidentally let the butter warm up too long in the microwave the resultant melted butter will not spill all over. And the dish could be as a little serving platter to place the cupcake, cheese and so on. Good Size for Butter - Better Butter is the solution to your butter conundrum. The East Coast makes long and skinny sticks of butter, while sticks of butter on the West Coast are shorter and fatter. With so many butter choices you need a butter dish to accommodate them all. The Internal dimensions are 5.75 inches (L) and 3.1 inches (W). It could hold a stick of east/west coast standard butter with ease. Also, It fits 8oz Kerrygold butter. (BUT not fit 1lb butter) Sturdy, No Sliding - These butter dishes are made of porcelain that wouldn't easily break or chip. It is nice and heavy so that when you're slicing off a pat of butter, it won't move out from under the pressure of the knife. Durable enough for microwave, oven, and dishwasher use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Wia1GXyEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Better Butter","source_asin":"B099N9YYB2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-845069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099N9YYB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099N9YYB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
