window.products.push({"id":845593,"name":"Dreamslink 12 Piece Double Shower Curtain Rings Rustproof Stainless Steel Chrome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519ydzWzNbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of beauty to the bath with the adorable creative specialties by Dreamslink double shower curtain ring. It is available in many finishes to choose from. The shower curtain hooks creates a bright, highly reflective, cool gray metallic look that enhances the overall look. This curtain ring is corrosion resistant, which makes it look and stay like new for a long time. It has an offset hook design that helps to hide the liner from view. The ring features smooth rolling ball bearings that eliminates snagging, tugging, and pulling of the curtains. It blends well and fits most shower curtains and rod types. This double shower curtain set from creative specialties by Dreamslink is constructed from steel, which makes it robust and durable. Features -Double shower curtain ring -Create a bright, highly reflective, cool grey metallic look -Offset hook design helps hide liner from view -Separates decorative curtain from liner -Corrosion-resistant -Smooth rolling ball bearings eliminate snagging, tugging and pulling of the curtain, fits most shower curtain and rod types -Constructed of steel -Style: Modern / Contemporary -Orientation: Wall Mounted Installation Instructions: 1. Hang all 12 rings on the shower rod.(Make sure the high end of the ring is facing the outside of the tub) 2. Thread the ball caps through the open end of the shower liner. The shower liner should be on the low end of the ring facing the inside of the tub. 3. Thread the ball caps through the open end of the decorative shower curtain. The shower curtain should be on the high end of the ring facing the outside of the tub. Package Included: 12 pieces shower curtain hooks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519ydzWzNbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dreamslink","source_asin":"B01904YTBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-845593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01904YTBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01904YTBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
