window.products.push({"id":845713,"name":"KAF by HIC 02623RB Striped Dish Cloths, Heavyweight Cotton, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pFKvuqPJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KAF Striped Dish Cloths are specially designed from heavyweight cotton with a basketweave texture to wash surfaces quickly without scratching. Extra large and super absorbent, each dish cloth measures 14 x 14-inches to cover more surface, so it’s easier to finish housework in less time. Made from extra-soft heavyweight lint-free cotton that won't scratch delicate surfaces, they’re perfect for making quick work of washing dishes, glasses, stemware, barware, crystal, and fine china. A must-have of cleaning and houseware supplies, they’re extra helpful for cleaning every surface in the kitchen, office, boat, camper, and more. A convenient hanging loop makes air drying easy after each use easy. Made from 100-percent easy-care cotton fabric, simply machine wash with a mild laundry detergent as needed and tumble dry. Set of 2 dish cloths.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pFKvuqPJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIC Kitchen","source_asin":"B08R4N1QRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-845713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R4N1QRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R4N1QRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":845714,"name":"Official Pusheen Photo Album - 6x4 Photo Album / 10x15 cm - Family Photo Album 100 Pockets- Pusheen Gifts - Pusheen Cat - Friend Gifts - Photo Albums ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.7,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jDMVJvGcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Photo albums are the perfect way to showcase your special memories. Whether you want to put pictures of your wedding up or those precious first baby photo's we all love to look back on special moments and what better way than to display them in a beautiful photo album book. Photo albums are also a great way to store a large number of photos in one place. We've all been round at our parents’ house, especially when a new friend or special someone is brought round for the first time, and inevitably the photo album comes out. Once you have gotten over the initial embarrassment of your younger self being put on display (ahem) you quickly feel nostalgic and find yourself pawing through the pages for hours, remembering all those wonderful times you had as a family. Photo albums are primarily intended for use with photographs, there's no reason why can't also be used to surround a hard-earned certificate or to display a drawing from your budding artist. A well-framed photo makes a fantastic gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jDMVJvGcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grupo Erik","source_asin":"B09WJZNYGH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-845714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WJZNYGH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WJZNYGH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
