window.products.push({"id":845771,"name":"Arctic Aire ADR30B1G 30 Pint Dehumidifier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PpDEJScuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Arctic Aire ADR30B1G 30 Pint Dehumidifier Arctic Aire ADR30B1G dehumidifier You will never have to worry about damp, stale air again with this elite 30-pint (14.2 liter) capacity dehumidifier from Danby. This portable Energy Star-compliant unit will minimize electricity costs and is ideal for areas up to 1,500 square feet in size. It runs on R410A refrigerant, making it very environmentally efficient and the quiet two-speed fan is perfect for circulating the air. The attractive model comes with easy-to-use electronic controls with a LED display feature as well as an automatic-restart component. The unit’s low-temperature element and direct-drain features enable it to operate continuously until the temperature reaches 5° Celsius (41° Fahrenheit) while the smart automatic de-icing system makes sure that the coils stay ice free. The adjustable humidity settings can be programmed quite effortlessly and the air filter is removable making it as easy as pie to clean. This solid dehumidifier can easily be moved from room to room due to the built-in castors and it comes with a 24-month warranty on parts and labor with carry-in service. How it works Your Danby Dehumidifier can be broken down into 5 main components: Fan, Compressor, Reheater, Compressor Cooling Coils, and Reservoir. All of these parts fit together to pull moisture out of the air by a fan that collects air from the surrounding area and pulls it into the dehumidifier. As the air passes through, it comes into contact with the dehumidifier's cooled coils. These coils use condensation to pull moisture from the air. The collected moisture remains on the coils and drips into the dehumidifier's reservoir. The dehumidifier reheats the air and exhausts it back into the room. Using your Dehumidifier - really save on your utility bills and diminish your Carbon footprint Set the Humidistat at a reasonable level, at Danby we suggest that you set the desired humidity to between 40 - 50 percent Set the Humidistat at a reasonable level, at Danby we suggest that you set the desired humidity to between 40 - 50 percent Keep your doors and windows closed when your Danby Dehumidifier is running Keep your doors and windows closed when your Danby Dehumidifier is running Keep it away from sources of excessive dust or dirt, since this can very quickly clog the machine Keep it away from sources of excessive dust or dirt, since this can very quickly clog the machine Be sure to check and clean your dehumidifier's filter regularly -- this will help ensure that it's operating as efficiently as possible Be sure to check and clean your dehumidifier's filter regularly -- this will help ensure that it's operating as efficiently as possible The water produced by your Danby Dehumidifier is referred to as greywater. It is not suitable for drinking water, but it can be great for watering houseplants and flowers, since it's less salty than tap water The water produced by your Danby Dehumidifier is referred to as greywater. It is not suitable for drinking water, but it can be great for watering houseplants and flowers, since it's less salty than tap water Compare ProductsADR30B1G - 30 pintsADR50B1G - 50 pintsADR70B1G - 70 pints Energy Star ✓✓✓ Auto re-start ✓✓✓ Warranty - 2 years parts and labor ✓✓✓ Air filter ✓✓✓ Direct drain ✓✓✓ 24 hour timer ✓✓✓ Auto re-start ✓✓✓ Bucket full indication ✓✓✓","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PpDEJScuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Danby","source_asin":"B00JWU5OIW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-845771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JWU5OIW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JWU5OIW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
