window.products.push({"id":845787,"name":"Shower Storage for Inside Shower, 3 Pack Shower Organizer with Hooks and Soap Holder, Adhesive Wall Mount Shower Shelves, Rustproof Black Shower Caddy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iU+2RKsvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✿【Upgrade Rustproof Material】Our shower holder organizer is made of high-quality space aluminum, which has comprehensive advantages that stainless steel can not contend with, non-fading, scratch-resistant, corrosion-resistant, rust-resistant and durable. Shower shelves for inside shower will not require you to maintain it regularly and it's an ideal choice for supplementing your bathroom. ✿【Large Bathroom Shower Caddy】This shower caddy basket shelf load-bearing capacity reach up to 40LB, the shower storage for inside shower with large capacity allows you to store more shower accessories like shampoo, conditioner, body wash, face wash, shaving cream and other bathroom essentials. ✿【Perfect Shower Organizer Set】The 3 pack shower shelves meets all your needs, which can keep your bathroom clean and tidy. Towels bar and ingenious shaver hook design make everything stay where it should be,it is suitable for bathrooms, kitchens, Rv, living rooms and bedrooms, with the soap dish to make your family space use to the extreme. Bathtub organizer for shower with deepen the fence design to prevents items from falling. 【Applicable to All Walls】 There have two installation methods for the shower wall caddy: 1. Use non-marking adhesive for installation, adhesive shower caddy will no damage to the wall, suitable for smooth tiles, smooth marble, tempered glass, smooth wooden wall, smooth solid metal, etc. 2. Use nails for installation, we supply enough parts for installation, suitable for uneven or rough surfaces, such as painted walls, cement walls, or lime walls. ✿【What Will You Get】 2 x black shower caddy is designed with removable towel bars and hooks, 1 x soap dish holder, 6 x high-strength adhesives, 3 x screw kit and 1 x small wrench. If you have any questions during the use of our shower caddy basket shelf, please consult our customer service staff. We hope to provide you with a pleasant shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iU+2RKsvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AN ANEWSIR","source_asin":"B0BP7MVQTW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-845787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP7MVQTW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP7MVQTW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
