window.products.push({"id":845799,"name":"YEMOTTS K Cup Holder, Side Mount K Cup Holder-Coffee Pod Holder Hanging K Cup Holder for Counter Small Space- Coffee Pod Holders for K Cups Wall Mount","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xI7XBn3tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Principle: The coffee pod holder adopts the diamond cutting principle，so that the stability and quality of the k cup holder is more solid and guaranteed, let you do not have to worry about the quality and safety problems of the k cup holder when using. Appearance: ABS plastic, there are two high quality 3M rubber pads and two screw holes on the k cup holder, the k cup holder a row can holds 5 K cup pods, our coffee pod holder also has a variety of colors for you to choose, so both in the installation and in the color choice can give you a better choice. Save space: This k cup holder apart from others is that it can be attached directly to the coffee machine for easy storage, instead of being stacked on the table like some ordinary k cup holders, saving a lot of space for storing other items. Bottom Design: Coffee pod holder bottom snap design will not allow the capsule to slide down, and it is also convenient to take out the coffee capsule. Multiple Uses: It can be installed on the walls of kitchen, cabinet, refrigerator, etc., or anywhere in the office area. This is a great idea for coffee lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xI7XBn3tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YEMOTTS","source_asin":"B0BLXKW44N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-845799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLXKW44N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLXKW44N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
