window.products.push({"id":845836,"name":"Waffle Weave King Blanket 102\"x90\"-White,King Cotton Blanket,Farmhouse Throw Blankets,White King Blanket,Breathable Blanket,Farmhouse Throw Blanket,Th","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XmdwyFJXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each package contains one waffle weave design 100% pure cotton thermal blanket - King size 90 inch x 102 inch. 100% Pure cotton for softness, absorbency, and durability - Luxurious all season blanket. Medium weight ideal for all seasons. Ideal for layering with any bedding ensemble. ALL YEAR BLANKET! The waffle weave make it possible to use all year round; this blanket will keep you cool through the summer, and will keep you warm through the long winter months. Easy care machine wash and dry, softens up with washing. Made from 100% natural materials and no harmful chemicals or synthetic materials are added.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XmdwyFJXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ramanta Home","source_asin":"B07F2NML9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-845836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F2NML9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F2NML9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":845837,"name":"Kitchen Rugs and Mats Pineapple 2 Piece Anti Fatigue Mat Kitchen Non Skid Kitchen Floor Mats Rubber Back Absorbent Washable Kitchen Rug Set Green Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q8+w7edjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"✅【Durable Kitchen Rugs and Mats 】This comfort pineapple kitchen mat set made from soft microfiber surface and TPR thermoplastic rubber non-slip backing,Material: 5% Polyester 95% Rubber. kitchen floor mat are eco-friendly kitchen mat, adopts environmental printing and dyeing process to make it non-fading and non-shrink,it is hemmed by hands on all edges for longevity and durability.Elegant unique pineapple deisgn make your kitchen more stylish and comfortable,never go out of style. ✅【Non-skid Kitchen Rug】Kitchen mats comes with anti-slip rubber back can ensure you and your family safe when cooking, works on multiple surfaces (wood, ceramic, laminate, marble, concrete, etc). The modern clean design makes kitchen carpet suitable for homes, offices, and even commercial spaces such as hotels and industrial facilities,and perfect for any kitchen, deck, patio, porch, veranda and entryway. ✅【Cushioned Supported 】This thick anti-fatigue kitchen mat provides ample support for your foot and knees over long periods of standing. Whether you’re cooking, preparing food, or working at your standing desk, this comfort kitchen floor mats for in front of sink is sure to provide comfort and help relieve pressure on your feet, knees, lower back, and joints. ✅【Easy To Clean】Pineapple kitchen mats are quick and easy to clean, just spray off with a hose or use a sponge and mild detergent to clean off dirt or yard debris. our kitchen mats sets can help avoid oily water leaving ugly stains on your floor when cooking. The soft surface of washable kitchen floor mat can also keep falling sharp and fragile utensils from damaging your floor. ✅【Kitchen Mats for Floor 2 Piece】Kitchen mat set include one small rug for kitchen 17\" x 29\" and one large kitchen rug 17\" x 47\", features 0.25\" slim. One long and one short kitchen mat set just the right size for the kitchen. Our stylish kitchen mats make a beautiful addition to your kitchen, dining room, craft rooms and office spaces,perfect for home decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q8+w7edjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LISIBOOO","source_asin":"B09DT2KD5L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-845837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DT2KD5L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DT2KD5L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":845838,"name":"Wilton Armetale William and Mary Serving Bowl, Medium, Round, 12-3/4-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DWT39TFML._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description WILTON ARMETALE offers a creative way to cook and serve every day. This intricately designed Round Serving Bowl is part of our popular William and Mary collection. Based on the coat-of-arms of William III and Queen Mary, this intricate, baroque-inspired design adds a sense of grandeur to the table. All of our pieces are designed for both decorative and practical use making them appropriate for parties, dinners or simply everyday use. Constructed of 100% recycled food-safe aluminum based alloy, Wilton Armetale cookware and serveware will not rust, crack, chip, dent, or tarnish. Bring our pieces straight to the table for an attractive presentation that keeps food hotter longer. Our metal has been independently tested and approved for both cooking and serving food. You can also pre-chill to use for condiments, cheeses, crudités, dips, and more. Unit measures 12-3/4-inch by 3-inch. To clean, hand wash with hot soapy water and towel dry. Do not put in the microwave or dishwasher. With proper care your Armetale treasures can last a lifetime. A family-owned company since 1892, Wilton Armetale offers a vast array of cookware and serveware designed to capture the spirit of your life. Amazon.com Since 1892, Wilton Armetale has constructed unique serving pieces in silver and pewter, gracefully combining beauty and durability. Individually handcrafted in Lancaster, Pennsylvania, no two pieces are exactly alike. Non-toxic metal ensures the safety of all food items, and effectively keeps a side dish or main course at the desired temperature. Wilton Armetale guarantees that under normal circumstances, serveware pieces will not rust, tarnish, crack, chip, or dent. Based upon the coat-of-arms of William III and Queen Mary, this intricate, baroque-inspired design adds a sense of grandeur to the table. Elaborate scrollwork, meandering vines, and interwoven flowers are opulently sculpted in low relief, adding a sense of regal dignity. Measuring 12-3/4 inches in diameter, this medium round bowl complements other tableware pieces in the same pattern. The detailed design covers much of the upper rim, offsetting the highly polished interior serving area. Standing 3- inches tall, and resting on a small base, the bowl sits securely on any surface because of its substantial weight. For best results, Wilton Armetale recommends washing all serving pieces by hand, and instructs users not to place them in the microwave or dishwasher. --Lea Werbel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DWT39TFML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton Armetale","source_asin":"B0000B2ID9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-845838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000B2ID9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000B2ID9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
