window.products.push({"id":845968,"name":"Rotating Bookshelf 360 Display 4 Tier Floor Standing Bookcase Storage Rack for Kids&Adults Solid Wood Bookshelf Organizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PzqPqq89L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Size: The diameter is larger than other products! The total height of the bookshelf: 50.4 inch (128cm). A total of 4 layers, each layer height: 11.6 inch (29.5cm). Diameter: 17.3 inch (44cm). Material: solid wood (pine)! Safe and stable, no paint or glue! Pretty stable: Once assembled, it is very stable, and it has been tested that children under the age of 14 cannot push it down. During the entire rotation process of the bookshelf, the bookshelf will not have any shaking. Space saving: Takes up very little space. Can be placed in any corner of the room. But it can make every room look like a small library. Free assembly mode: can be assembled into a 1-layer, 2-layer, 3-layer or 4-layer bookshelf at will. Super large capacity: It can hold about 100 medium-sized books. Tall/deep enough to fit trade paperback graphic novels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PzqPqq89L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heehee","source_asin":"B0BJCNRD5H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-845968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJCNRD5H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJCNRD5H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
