window.products.push({"id":845984,"name":"Sous Vide Machine Immersion Circulator: Ultra-quiet Precision Sous-vide Cooker, IPX7 Waterproof Stainless Steel 1100W Professional Low Temperature Slo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719XrsBNooL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STAINLESS STEEL DESIGN: The parts of G300T sous vide in contact with water are made of food-grade SUS304 stainless steel, which is safe, robust, and high temperature resistant, avoiding any plastic materials that produce harmful substances when used at high temperatures for a long time! NOISE-FREE BRUSHLESS DC MOTOR: G300T suvee cooker adopts the same quality brushless motor as high-end UAV, which is very quiet. At the same time, the stainless steel sleeve diamond-shaped water inlet design and stainless steel double-sided inclined 45-degree angle spiral design pulsator reduce noise. PRECISE TEMPERATURE CONTROL: The precision cooker with high-power brushless DC motor and high-precision control chip ensure rapid heating during cooking, accurate temperature detection, and temperature stability. Temperature range 104°F-194°F (40°C-90°C). HEATED EVENLY: G300T sous-vide machine adopts super power motor, 2900r/m uniform rotation, and 16L/min water flow design, which improves the internal circulation speed of water. Cooking more ingredients in one pot can also ensure uniform heating. WATERPROOF & EASY TO CLEAN: Sous vide cooker has passed IPX7 waterproof certification, and the whole machine can be washed in water. Removable stainless steel sleeve allows deep cleaning of stains in every crevice. UNIQUE CARBON FIBER PATTERN: Brand new carbon fiber pattern design, elegant and good-looking. Comes with the perfect gift box packaging, this immersion cooker perfect as a birthday or holiday gift for family and friends. MUTE OPTIONS: G300T sous vide machine immersion circulator with mute design, press and hold \"℃/°F\" and \"+\" simultaneously for 3 seconds to mute mode. HEALTHY COOKING: Low-temperature sous-vide cooking preserves the moisture and nutrients of raw materials, sous vide immersion circulator making food taste better and healthier. Simple cooking also allows you to enjoy Michelin chef quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719XrsBNooL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenBoss","source_asin":"B0B3LM5BMN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-845984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3LM5BMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3LM5BMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
